(4959014, 722389, 32011, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  As I mentioned to another entry with this theme, I was considering doing this, but couldn''t pull it off anywhere nearly as well as you''ve done here.  <br/> <br/>The colours are good, the tilt gives it a dynamic... an edge, which adds a risk to the safety theme... I like it.  <br/> <br/>Where the image suffers... the red line in the background is a tad distracting, and the reflection in the surface is an issue for me as it looks OOF or doubled up (sometimes get two reflections from a pain of glass... one on each surface).<br/> <br/>Overall, you''ve done exceptionally well with this photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Brilliant.  As I mentioned to another entry with this theme, I was considering doing this, but couldn''t pull it off anywhere nearly as well as you''ve done here.   The colours are good, the tilt gives it a dynamic... an edge, which adds a risk to the safety theme... I like it.   Where the image suffers... the red line in the background is a tad distracting, and the reflection in the surface is an issue for me as it looks OOF or doubled up (sometimes get two reflections from a pain of glass... one on each surface). Overall, you''ve done exceptionally well with this photo.  Well done!', '2008-09-17 01:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959018, 722012, 36006, '<td valign="top">Timmmmmmmmmmmyyyyyy.........</td>', 'Timmmmmmmmmmmyyyyyy.........', '2008-09-17 01:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
