(4960273, 722204, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A nice try at humor but the lighting / post processing of this image is not very good.  The skin tones look like this was taken with light from a light bulb and the image is a little dark.  This might have worked better with light from a window.</td>', 'Back to comment: A nice try at humor but the lighting / post processing of this image is not very good.  The skin tones look like this was taken with light from a light bulb and the image is a little dark.  This might have worked better with light from a window.', '2008-09-17 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
