(4960352, 722062, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant, good DOF too.</td>', 'Very vibrant, good DOF too.', '2008-09-17 17:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960356, 722253, 94265, '<td valign="top">That is so adorable, with his little wing covering his baby brother. Sweet shot and a good take on the challenge. 9.</td>', 'That is so adorable, with his little wing covering his baby brother. Sweet shot and a good take on the challenge. 9.', '2008-09-17 17:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960384, 722222, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked this to have been a full upper body shot, not just zoned in on the stomach but I like the idea and the focus is fantastic.</td>', 'I''d have liked this to have been a full upper body shot, not just zoned in on the stomach but I like the idea and the focus is fantastic.', '2008-09-17 17:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960388, 720759, 97900, '<td valign="top">closer to the lock would have been a little better</td>', 'closer to the lock would have been a little better', '2008-09-17 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960390, 721263, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wish the packet wasn''t clipped off on the left but otherwise, this is a really good shot and pretty funny too, as it looks like he''s banging his head on her baby bump in that disbelieving, slow, comedic fashion.</td>', 'I wish the packet wasn''t clipped off on the left but otherwise, this is a really good shot and pretty funny too, as it looks like he''s banging his head on her baby bump in that disbelieving, slow, comedic fashion.', '2008-09-17 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960395, 722281, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good shot, like the DOF.</td>', 'Good shot, like the DOF.', '2008-09-17 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960401, 722156, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the title but the shot is pretty good, I like the colour. This makes me think of drinking and driving, which would''ve actually been a better entry for the risk challenge.</td>', 'Not sure I get the title but the shot is pretty good, I like the colour. This makes me think of drinking and driving, which would''ve actually been a better entry for the risk challenge.', '2008-09-17 17:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960407, 722389, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is quite clever, I do like it, though the red light distracts a little.</td>', 'This is quite clever, I do like it, though the red light distracts a little.', '2008-09-17 17:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960415, 722341, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the positioning, mum''s back seems to be too much in the shot. I''d like to have seen the kid''s face in the middle more, with more of the mum''s head in shot; not being able to see her arms kinda makes the title not work. The shot itself is really nice though, the b&amp;w looks good and the kid''s expression is sweet.</td>', 'Not sure I like the positioning, mum''s back seems to be too much in the shot. I''d like to have seen the kid''s face in the middle more, with more of the mum''s head in shot; not being able to see her arms kinda makes the title not work. The shot itself is really nice though, the b&w looks good and the kid''s expression is sweet.', '2008-09-17 17:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960424, 722165, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can see this ribboning, it''s beautiful and razor-sharp focus on the owl. Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'I can see this ribboning, it''s beautiful and razor-sharp focus on the owl. Good take on the challenge.', '2008-09-17 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960425, 722216, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the ocean lighthouse/beacon idea, the water looks a bit smooth but all in all a nice shot.</td>', 'I like the ocean lighthouse/beacon idea, the water looks a bit smooth but all in all a nice shot.', '2008-09-17 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960428, 721856, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure yet about the crop but the light is good and the borders work well.</td>', 'Not sure yet about the crop but the light is good and the borders work well.', '2008-09-17 17:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960433, 722288, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really like the thimble idea and the editing looks good, whatever that is in the background distracts me a bit though.</td>', 'I really like the thimble idea and the editing looks good, whatever that is in the background distracts me a bit though.', '2008-09-17 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960437, 720919, 94265, '<td valign="top">What''s the purpose of these things? I''ve no clue what they are. The shot is good though, very clear, I just don''t recognise the subject.</td>', 'What''s the purpose of these things? I''ve no clue what they are. The shot is good though, very clear, I just don''t recognise the subject.', '2008-09-17 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960440, 722312, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that strange edit much, I love the cut-in-half look of the person and the vibrant background, I just find the edit you''ve used a bit unappealing.</td>', 'I don''t like that strange edit much, I love the cut-in-half look of the person and the vibrant background, I just find the edit you''ve used a bit unappealing.', '2008-09-17 17:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960441, 721351, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is identical to another shot in the challenge, it''s never a good idea to get your entry at the exact time and in the same spot as another contender. The idea is cute enough.</td>', 'This is identical to another shot in the challenge, it''s never a good idea to get your entry at the exact time and in the same spot as another contender. The idea is cute enough.', '2008-09-17 17:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960446, 721776, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out how you did this effect with the fire but it looks pretty good!</td>', 'I can''t make out how you did this effect with the fire but it looks pretty good!', '2008-09-17 17:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960452, 720465, 94265, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge in my eyes, save for the title. It''s a cute portrait and pretty clear but her face is a wee bit blown out.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge in my eyes, save for the title. It''s a cute portrait and pretty clear but her face is a wee bit blown out.', '2008-09-17 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960465, 722332, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective and tones, that sun flare is a bit harsh on the eyes but it''s a great shot. 7.</td>', 'Cool perspective and tones, that sun flare is a bit harsh on the eyes but it''s a great shot. 7.', '2008-09-17 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960468, 722106, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus, would''ve liked to see a little more of their faces. Maybe it''s just this angle but they don''t look very content together which spoils the idea a bit for me. Love the black and white though.</td>', 'Nice soft focus, would''ve liked to see a little more of their faces. Maybe it''s just this angle but they don''t look very content together which spoils the idea a bit for me. Love the black and white though.', '2008-09-17 18:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960469, 722204, 94265, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, photo is a wee bit dim though, maybe bringing in a lamp would''ve helped a bit.</td>', 'Funny idea, photo is a wee bit dim though, maybe bringing in a lamp would''ve helped a bit.', '2008-09-17 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960470, 721793, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good idea and great lighting.</td>', 'Good idea and great lighting.', '2008-09-17 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960472, 722390, 94265, '<td valign="top">Either the contrast is a wee bit high or it''s a bit oversharpened, the crop and angle are good though and I like the faint blue.</td>', 'Either the contrast is a wee bit high or it''s a bit oversharpened, the crop and angle are good though and I like the faint blue.', '2008-09-17 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960481, 722342, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really like the boldness and vibrancy of this, that glare in the middle of the packet is a bit distracting but I know from experience that it''s near unavoidable with a shiny wrapper!</td>', 'I really like the boldness and vibrancy of this, that glare in the middle of the packet is a bit distracting but I know from experience that it''s near unavoidable with a shiny wrapper!', '2008-09-17 18:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960525, 721287, 50695, '<td valign="top">awww I like this. A good abstract pattern that slowly draws you in to the hidden subject.</td>', 'awww I like this. A good abstract pattern that slowly draws you in to the hidden subject.', '2008-09-17 18:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960526, 722261, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not to sound emasculating or anything, but that looks like an awful big hole for that drill.</td>', 'Not to sound emasculating or anything, but that looks like an awful big hole for that drill.', '2008-09-17 18:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960528, 722221, 50695, '<td valign="top">something''s wrong with the composition. I think the centered subject makes the random stuff on the edges seem... well... random.</td>', 'something''s wrong with the composition. I think the centered subject makes the random stuff on the edges seem... well... random.', '2008-09-17 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960530, 721772, 50695, '<td valign="top">Okay, so was this serendipity or did you put that duck there, eh?</td>', 'Okay, so was this serendipity or did you put that duck there, eh?', '2008-09-17 19:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960540, 722341, 50695, '<td valign="top">The white background is a little creepy and is also creating strange border effects. The composition is mostly good but there''s something about the square or not-quite-square shape that doesn''t appeal to me. It looks like a fat square.</td>', 'The white background is a little creepy and is also creating strange border effects. The composition is mostly good but there''s something about the square or not-quite-square shape that doesn''t appeal to me. It looks like a fat square.', '2008-09-17 19:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
