(4960561, 722314, 50695, '<td valign="top">Safety? This is over my head. I always thought such animals were most vulnerable when they go to the river to drink.</td>', 'Safety? This is over my head. I always thought such animals were most vulnerable when they go to the river to drink.', '2008-09-17 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
