(4960578, 722005, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the glass leads to the shadow of the glass which leads to the safety pin. Nice subtlety there.  I like the picture, too. Good composition.</td>', 'I like how the glass leads to the shadow of the glass which leads to the safety pin. Nice subtlety there.  I like the picture, too. Good composition.', '2008-09-17 19:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
