(4960823, 722062, 54478, '<td valign="top">I feel that the right side of the extinguisher is a little over exposed. I also feel that there is too much read. If you had a white backdrop, that would have helped tremendously. The red background just makes the fire extinguisher and the background blend together. On the right hand side of the photo, at the top of extinguisher, right above the label, I can''t tell where the outline of the extinguisher beings or ends.</td>', 'I feel that the right side of the extinguisher is a little over exposed. I also feel that there is too much read. If you had a white backdrop, that would have helped tremendously. The red background just makes the fire extinguisher and the background blend together. On the right hand side of the photo, at the top of extinguisher, right above the label, I can''t tell where the outline of the extinguisher beings or ends.', '2008-09-17 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4960824, 721936, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love the use of texture in this photo.</td>', 'Great photo. I love the use of texture in this photo.', '2008-09-17 21:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
