(4961494, 721335, 84438, '<td valign="top">This is great.  The lighting is very, very effective, and the levels are good.<br/> <br/>At first glance though, this almost looks like the subject is in a dungeon or somewhere quite ''unsafe''!  My opinion only.</td>', 'This is great.  The lighting is very, very effective, and the levels are good. At first glance though, this almost looks like the subject is in a dungeon or somewhere quite ''unsafe''!  My opinion only.', '2008-09-18 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961496, 722306, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump:  The relationship to safety is very weak, as I''m sure that the DNMC Police are letting you know.  This image is fun to look at and I''m adding it to my favorites.  However, the weak link to the challenge topic only allows me to give this a 5.  In a water challenge, this would be worthy of a 10 from me.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump:  The relationship to safety is very weak, as I''m sure that the DNMC Police are letting you know.  This image is fun to look at and I''m adding it to my favorites.  However, the weak link to the challenge topic only allows me to give this a 5.  In a water challenge, this would be worthy of a 10 from me.', '2008-09-18 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961499, 721170, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  Interesting perpective and the overall composition of the image is strong.  I like the focus, the lighting, and the natural looking post processing.  However, the title is the only thing that convey safety with this entry.</td>', 'Back to comment:  Interesting perpective and the overall composition of the image is strong.  I like the focus, the lighting, and the natural looking post processing.  However, the title is the only thing that convey safety with this entry.', '2008-09-18 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961501, 721909, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good idea for safety, it''s cool that you managed to get so many in one line for the shot.</td>', 'Good idea for safety, it''s cool that you managed to get so many in one line for the shot.', '2008-09-18 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961503, 722046, 84438, '<td valign="top">Really provocative photo.  A great idea, and I think it meets the challenge very well.<br/> <br/>Though your concept is great, there are some technical issues with this photo IMHO.  I think if the shadows were closer and darker, it would be more effective.  I wish the photo wasn''t cropped so close.<br/> <br/>Excellent idea, and you get points for originally, which in my opinion is severely lacking here.</td>', 'Really provocative photo.  A great idea, and I think it meets the challenge very well. Though your concept is great, there are some technical issues with this photo IMHO.  I think if the shadows were closer and darker, it would be more effective.  I wish the photo wasn''t cropped so close. Excellent idea, and you get points for originally, which in my opinion is severely lacking here.', '2008-09-18 11:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961504, 722155, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice enough shot, quite a lot out of focus though.</td>', 'Nice enough shot, quite a lot out of focus though.', '2008-09-18 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961505, 720408, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The horizon looks off, and the foreground is a bit dark compared to the blown background.  The ''safe'' concept isn''t really jumping out at me.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The horizon looks off, and the foreground is a bit dark compared to the blown background.  The ''safe'' concept isn''t really jumping out at me.', '2008-09-18 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961506, 720919, 84438, '<td valign="top">Cool, and I really like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Cool, and I really like the B&W.', '2008-09-18 11:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961507, 721290, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the point of including duckies in this was. The yellow contrasts nicely with the blue, though the glare on the condom wrapper is a bit bright.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the point of including duckies in this was. The yellow contrasts nicely with the blue, though the glare on the condom wrapper is a bit bright.', '2008-09-18 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961508, 721853, 84438, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  Love it!</td>', 'Hehe.  Love it!', '2008-09-18 11:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961509, 721290, 84438, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, and points for originality!</td>', 'Technically well done, and points for originality!', '2008-09-18 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961510, 722183, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  I don''t see much in this photo that relates to safety.  Regarding the image itself, the wrinkles in the background are not very appealing and the lighting is uneven, causing loss of detail in the dark areas of the insect.  The focus appears to be good, with the head of the insect looking sharp.</td>', 'Back to comment:  I don''t see much in this photo that relates to safety.  Regarding the image itself, the wrinkles in the background are not very appealing and the lighting is uneven, causing loss of detail in the dark areas of the insect.  The focus appears to be good, with the head of the insect looking sharp.', '2008-09-18 11:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961511, 722261, 94265, '<td valign="top">Something''s a bit off with the light here I feel but I like the shot and the idea.</td>', 'Something''s a bit off with the light here I feel but I like the shot and the idea.', '2008-09-18 11:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961515, 722156, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump:  The image is well done (lighting, exposure, post processing).  The composition is a little weak, with both the glass and the keys centered in the image.  The link to safety is weak, as the image itself doesn''t sell the don''t drink and drive purpose of MADD very well. 5</td>', 'Back to comment and bump:  The image is well done (lighting, exposure, post processing).  The composition is a little weak, with both the glass and the keys centered in the image.  The link to safety is weak, as the image itself doesn''t sell the don''t drink and drive purpose of MADD very well. 5', '2008-09-18 11:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961517, 722196, 84438, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Composition is good, lighting is good.  Nice visual interest with the lighthouse and the birds on the rock.  Too bad the lighthouse wasn''t a bit brighter, but what are you gonna do in Basic.<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Cool.  Composition is good, lighting is good.  Nice visual interest with the lighthouse and the birds on the rock.  Too bad the lighthouse wasn''t a bit brighter, but what are you gonna do in Basic. Great job.', '2008-09-18 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961518, 722222, 84438, '<td valign="top">Technically a great photo, and a good original concept!</td>', 'Technically a great photo, and a good original concept!', '2008-09-18 11:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961519, 722159, 84438, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Was the soft focus done on purpose?  It doesn''t seem to add to the photo.  The lighting is very nice.</td>', 'Funny!  Was the soft focus done on purpose?  It doesn''t seem to add to the photo.  The lighting is very nice.', '2008-09-18 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961521, 722304, 84438, '<td valign="top">A nice photo.  Technically very good.</td>', 'A nice photo.  Technically very good.', '2008-09-18 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961526, 721776, 84438, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool painting with light shot!  I like what you did here.  The only nitpick I have is that I wish the extinguisher itself was lit better.<br/> <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'Pretty cool painting with light shot!  I like what you did here.  The only nitpick I have is that I wish the extinguisher itself was lit better. Nicely done!', '2008-09-18 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961527, 722174, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: This image doesn''t really fit the challenge topic very strongly.  As for the image itself, the composition is a bit bland with the flower being dead center.  This composition might have worked better if the lighting was more dramatic or if you could have pulled more contrast between the petals during post processing.  The water drops are a nice touch, as they strengthen the composition as a focal point.</td>', 'Back to comment: This image doesn''t really fit the challenge topic very strongly.  As for the image itself, the composition is a bit bland with the flower being dead center.  This composition might have worked better if the lighting was more dramatic or if you could have pulled more contrast between the petals during post processing.  The water drops are a nice touch, as they strengthen the composition as a focal point.', '2008-09-18 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961529, 722294, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure the composition is very appealing but I really like the idea.</td>', 'Not sure the composition is very appealing but I really like the idea.', '2008-09-18 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961530, 722050, 84438, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....  Technically excellent, but ''safety''?</td>', 'Hmmm....  Technically excellent, but ''safety''?', '2008-09-18 11:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961531, 722397, 94265, '<td valign="top">Haha this is a nice clear shot, the title made me smile!</td>', 'Haha this is a nice clear shot, the title made me smile!', '2008-09-18 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961532, 722323, 84438, '<td valign="top">Funny!!  Looks like you had a few too many when you came up with the concept of this photo! :)<br/> <br/>It''s pretty wacky, but I like it!</td>', 'Funny!!  Looks like you had a few too many when you came up with the concept of this photo! :) It''s pretty wacky, but I like it!', '2008-09-18 11:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961533, 722306, 94265, '<td valign="top">Behind one of those water domes in a swimming pool? Not enough of the face is distinguishable to me, the colours are nice.</td>', 'Behind one of those water domes in a swimming pool? Not enough of the face is distinguishable to me, the colours are nice.', '2008-09-18 11:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961534, 722183, 84438, '<td valign="top">A fear of bees = Safety?  I''m just not getting it.  An odd choice for a background for the bee to be on.  Lighting could have been better as well.  Sorry, I''m not into this one too much.</td>', 'A fear of bees = Safety?  I''m just not getting it.  An odd choice for a background for the bee to be on.  Lighting could have been better as well.  Sorry, I''m not into this one too much.', '2008-09-18 11:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961536, 722178, 84438, '<td valign="top">A nice photo!  Not sure if I''d describe these as ''gold''.  Maybe a colour adjustment would have helped?  Seems like a bit of a shoehorn for ''safety'' IMHO.</td>', 'A nice photo!  Not sure if I''d describe these as ''gold''.  Maybe a colour adjustment would have helped?  Seems like a bit of a shoehorn for ''safety'' IMHO.', '2008-09-18 11:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961537, 722117, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m meant to be seeing, or the safety relation. Bit blown out at the top.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m meant to be seeing, or the safety relation. Bit blown out at the top.', '2008-09-18 11:30:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4961543, 721360, 84438, '<td valign="top">You managed to take a pretty bland subject and make it visually interesting.  Looks like a little too much sunlight coming in, which is blowing out areas.  I like the composition.<br/> <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'You managed to take a pretty bland subject and make it visually interesting.  Looks like a little too much sunlight coming in, which is blowing out areas.  I like the composition. Nicely done!', '2008-09-18 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961544, 721887, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light is a wee bit off, I like the idea but I think maybe shooting this earlier in the day would''ve been better; the evening sky looks a bit bright and it makes the foreground of the photo look dim.</td>', 'The light is a wee bit off, I like the idea but I think maybe shooting this earlier in the day would''ve been better; the evening sky looks a bit bright and it makes the foreground of the photo look dim.', '2008-09-18 11:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961545, 722333, 84438, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Good lighting, good composition, good use of DOF.  The reflection looks a bit odd, but I like the photo overall.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Good lighting, good composition, good use of DOF.  The reflection looks a bit odd, but I like the photo overall.', '2008-09-18 11:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961547, 722401, 84438, '<td valign="top">Yeah, cool.  I like what you did here!  DOF is awesome, and nice lighting!  Composition, background.  All well done!</td>', 'Yeah, cool.  I like what you did here!  DOF is awesome, and nice lighting!  Composition, background.  All well done!', '2008-09-18 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961551, 720408, 94265, '<td valign="top">Safety in numbers? Safety with the comfort of company? Or a bit of a stretch for the challenge ;P  I like the view of the water, I''m not too keen on the table composition though, you can only see one of their faces. Maybe next time take the shot from in between 2 of them at a diagonal angle so you can see more of the table and the group.</td>', 'Safety in numbers? Safety with the comfort of company? Or a bit of a stretch for the challenge ;P  I like the view of the water, I''m not too keen on the table composition though, you can only see one of their faces. Maybe next time take the shot from in between 2 of them at a diagonal angle so you can see more of the table and the group.', '2008-09-18 11:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961556, 721271, 94265, '<td valign="top">The pic is very grainy, maybe from compression? The crop could''ve been a little wider too, so as not to cut off the wheels.</td>', 'The pic is very grainy, maybe from compression? The crop could''ve been a little wider too, so as not to cut off the wheels.', '2008-09-18 11:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961565, 722189, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: To me, a blanket provides comfort or security, not a real strong subject for a safety challenge.  On the image itself, it looks like this image was not sharpened after down sizing it for the challenge.  Down sizing causes the sharpness of an image to diminish (decrease).  Most people use Un-Sharp Mask (USM) after down sizing.  If you have Photoshop try USM with a Radius of 1 - Amount 100% - Threshold of 3 or smaller to help the eyes of the child look nice and sharp.  I also think that the composition could be strengthened a bit if some of the negative space on the left was cropped out.  I would have given you a bonus point if the boy was holding a Redwing blanket instead of an Islanders blanket but it is nice to see that it is a hockey blanket.<br/> <br/>If you have questions regarding resizing and USM, feel free to send me a PM.<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Back to comment: To me, a blanket provides comfort or security, not a real strong subject for a safety challenge.  On the image itself, it looks like this image was not sharpened after down sizing it for the challenge.  Down sizing causes the sharpness of an image to diminish (decrease).  Most people use Un-Sharp Mask (USM) after down sizing.  If you have Photoshop try USM with a Radius of 1 - Amount 100% - Threshold of 3 or smaller to help the eyes of the child look nice and sharp.  I also think that the composition could be strengthened a bit if some of the negative space on the left was cropped out.  I would have given you a bonus point if the boy was holding a Redwing blanket instead of an Islanders blanket but it is nice to see that it is a hockey blanket. If you have questions regarding resizing and USM, feel free to send me a PM. Tim', '2008-09-18 11:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961575, 720408, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  This image doesn''t relate to safety very strongly.  It also appears as if the horizon is tilting to the right.  I also noticed that your picture size is 569 x 379 pixels.  The challenges allow for 640 pixels on the longest side (569 for your image).  The larger the image, the more detail that is visible.</td>', 'Back to comment:  This image doesn''t relate to safety very strongly.  It also appears as if the horizon is tilting to the right.  I also noticed that your picture size is 569 x 379 pixels.  The challenges allow for 640 pixels on the longest side (569 for your image).  The larger the image, the more detail that is visible.', '2008-09-18 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961579, 721495, 94265, '<td valign="top">Little bit OOF there on the closest car. The border is good.</td>', 'Little bit OOF there on the closest car. The border is good.', '2008-09-18 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961581, 722212, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait, the light hits off their glasses a bit but otherwise, the light is good. Bumping up :)</td>', 'This is a nice portrait, the light hits off their glasses a bit but otherwise, the light is good. Bumping up :)', '2008-09-18 11:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961587, 722304, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump:  You''ve found a humorous title to fit an image into a safety challenge that really doesn''t relate strongly to safety.  For that, I am going to give you a bump.  According to the histogram on this image, the tonal range appears to be concentrated to the dark half of the histogram.  A small bump of the midtones using a curve layer will both brighten and improve the colors of you image.  Feel free to send me a PM if you need a better explanation regarding curves and the histogram.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump:  You''ve found a humorous title to fit an image into a safety challenge that really doesn''t relate strongly to safety.  For that, I am going to give you a bump.  According to the histogram on this image, the tonal range appears to be concentrated to the dark half of the histogram.  A small bump of the midtones using a curve layer will both brighten and improve the colors of you image.  Feel free to send me a PM if you need a better explanation regarding curves and the histogram.', '2008-09-18 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961590, 722138, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A lovely image with exceptional post processing.  However, the image doesn''t fit the challenge topic very strongly.</td>', 'Back to comment: A lovely image with exceptional post processing.  However, the image doesn''t fit the challenge topic very strongly.', '2008-09-18 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961646, 722108, 97893, '<td valign="top">I like the picture that you have created here and its relation to the theme.</td>', 'I like the picture that you have created here and its relation to the theme.', '2008-09-18 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
