(4961825, 720919, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool photo but I''m not really seeing anything about ''Safety''. Maybe it''s cause those things are not familiar to me as I live in the desert? Are they related to being around water?</td>', 'It''s a cool photo but I''m not really seeing anything about ''Safety''. Maybe it''s cause those things are not familiar to me as I live in the desert? Are they related to being around water?', '2008-09-18 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
