(4961838, 721853, 62187, '<td valign="top">What is that - the seasoning packet from top ramen? Large? Large what? I can''t read the other writing, it''s too blurry...but, you''re lucky I''m an adult and of course I know what that is: clever idea but it still is not quite clear. I''m sure the voters won''t ding you for that since this site is not really about photography anymore. 7</td>', 'What is that - the seasoning packet from top ramen? Large? Large what? I can''t read the other writing, it''s too blurry...but, you''re lucky I''m an adult and of course I know what that is: clever idea but it still is not quite clear. I''m sure the voters won''t ding you for that since this site is not really about photography anymore. 7', '2008-09-18 14:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961840, 721888, 98041, '<td valign="top">I think picture is really cute. Nice idea. I hope she is safe in that bucket.</td>', 'I think picture is really cute. Nice idea. I hope she is safe in that bucket.', '2008-09-18 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
