(4961850, 722050, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo. For me, it''s not screaming ''Safety'' at all and rather shoehornish having to rely a lot on the title to make it understandable. The borders seem unequal and along with your crop give it an off-balanced appearance.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo. For me, it''s not screaming ''Safety'' at all and rather shoehornish having to rely a lot on the title to make it understandable. The borders seem unequal and along with your crop give it an off-balanced appearance.', '2008-09-18 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961853, 721772, 68642, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Same photo (different angle) submitted by another member.</td>', 'Interesting. Same photo (different angle) submitted by another member.', '2008-09-18 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961859, 722100, 90663, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, you have an unfortunate case of the jaggies though, did you have to crop this image down a lot?</td>', 'Nice setup, you have an unfortunate case of the jaggies though, did you have to crop this image down a lot?', '2008-09-18 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961861, 722183, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had to google your title to find that Melissophobia is fear of bees. I don''t see how that relates to ''Safety'' and the photo is very out of focus for me. I can''t see that making it so on purpose would help relate it to Safety. Do you have Melissophobia? If so, the photos blurriness might make a little more sense.</td>', 'I had to google your title to find that Melissophobia is fear of bees. I don''t see how that relates to ''Safety'' and the photo is very out of focus for me. I can''t see that making it so on purpose would help relate it to Safety. Do you have Melissophobia? If so, the photos blurriness might make a little more sense.', '2008-09-18 14:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961866, 721360, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m all about Safety First - it''s my job. The photo is very crisp but for me, rather uninteresting. Luckily, I don''t rate photo on how interesting they are to me but rather on their quality and pertinence to the challenge.</td>', 'I''m all about Safety First - it''s my job. The photo is very crisp but for me, rather uninteresting. Luckily, I don''t rate photo on how interesting they are to me but rather on their quality and pertinence to the challenge.', '2008-09-18 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961867, 722108, 90663, '<td valign="top">I think I would have rotated the frame just enough to level out the field, I otherwise like the composition here, taking the picture from behind the subjects also emphasizes the action of the mom covering her child''s ears, without the distraction of the faces</td>', 'I think I would have rotated the frame just enough to level out the field, I otherwise like the composition here, taking the picture from behind the subjects also emphasizes the action of the mom covering her child''s ears, without the distraction of the faces', '2008-09-18 14:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961870, 722028, 62187, '<td valign="top">A bigger shoehorned photo then I think I''ve ever tried. Then again, there are no dragon flies where I live but it certainly gets bright here...</td>', 'A bigger shoehorned photo then I think I''ve ever tried. Then again, there are no dragon flies where I live but it certainly gets bright here...', '2008-09-18 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
