(4961876, 721793, 62187, '<td valign="top">Can''t offer anything helpful to improve your photo nor can I find any fault. The subtle reflection is awesome: great job on the lighting. It''s gotta be a ribbon contender or top 10 for sure. 10</td>', 'Can''t offer anything helpful to improve your photo nor can I find any fault. The subtle reflection is awesome: great job on the lighting. It''s gotta be a ribbon contender or top 10 for sure. 10', '2008-09-18 14:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
