(4961949, 721775, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  On a personal note, I''m not a big fan of the crop on this image.  You did a nice job of placing the dolphins compositionally but the crop ratio tells me you had a lot of other stuff you needed to get rid of.</td>', 'Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  On a personal note, I''m not a big fan of the crop on this image.  You did a nice job of placing the dolphins compositionally but the crop ratio tells me you had a lot of other stuff you needed to get rid of.', '2008-09-18 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961951, 722154, 90663, '<td valign="top">Focus needed to be sharper, and it feels cramped, would have pulled back a little further</td>', 'Focus needed to be sharper, and it feels cramped, would have pulled back a little further', '2008-09-18 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961954, 722323, 62187, '<td valign="top">What, is that a Lion Fish or something? I''m not a fan of things that look alcoholic and those bottles look like beer bottles to me. I always try to not let my feelings get in the way of scoring these photos but I passionately dislike glamorizing alcoholic beverages and I won''t let it this time either. I think your initial idea was clever but not executed very well. Could I do better? probably not.</td>', 'What, is that a Lion Fish or something? I''m not a fan of things that look alcoholic and those bottles look like beer bottles to me. I always try to not let my feelings get in the way of scoring these photos but I passionately dislike glamorizing alcoholic beverages and I won''t let it this time either. I think your initial idea was clever but not executed very well. Could I do better? probably not.', '2008-09-18 15:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961956, 722177, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  I do find the overall image to be interesting.  The perspective and leading lines bring you right to the umbrella.  However, your b&amp;w conversion could be better, as I would like to see more tonal range/contrast in the tree trunk.  There is a great tutorial on b&amp;w conversion in the DPC tutorial page.</td>', 'Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  I do find the overall image to be interesting.  The perspective and leading lines bring you right to the umbrella.  However, your b&w conversion could be better, as I would like to see more tonal range/contrast in the tree trunk.  There is a great tutorial on b&w conversion in the DPC tutorial page.', '2008-09-18 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961958, 722099, 90663, '<td valign="top">DOF may be a little too shallow, I think more sharpness in the foreground would have added to the impact</td>', 'DOF may be a little too shallow, I think more sharpness in the foreground would have added to the impact', '2008-09-18 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4961959, 722314, 62187, '<td valign="top">I fail to see how this represents ''Safety''. It seems more like a risk to me. What a beautiful place you must be in to see a creature like that. I wonder how many people even know what a ''Rut'' is.</td>', 'I fail to see how this represents ''Safety''. It seems more like a risk to me. What a beautiful place you must be in to see a creature like that. I wonder how many people even know what a ''Rut'' is.', '2008-09-18 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
