(4961981, 721316, 62187, '<td valign="top">This is the 3rd condom photo I''ve seen in this challenge and I''m only half way through and rather tired of them. It makes me wonder about society in general and their obsessions with sex. I don''t like the photo at all but it fits the challenge and the focus is nearly excellent: 9</td>', 'This is the 3rd condom photo I''ve seen in this challenge and I''m only half way through and rather tired of them. It makes me wonder about society in general and their obsessions with sex. I don''t like the photo at all but it fits the challenge and the focus is nearly excellent: 9', '2008-09-18 15:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
