(4961990, 722005, 62187, '<td valign="top">In a pinch...what? I''m guessing that''s a safety pin holing your shoulder strap up. Or maybe a bread tie. Maybe it''s not even a dress: maybe it''s a garbage bag? Maybe it''s not even a girl. But, I get your idea, it''s an interesting photo and in my opinion very artistic which I totally respect. Against my better judgment I''m scoring your photo a 10.</td>', 'In a pinch...what? I''m guessing that''s a safety pin holing your shoulder strap up. Or maybe a bread tie. Maybe it''s not even a dress: maybe it''s a garbage bag? Maybe it''s not even a girl. But, I get your idea, it''s an interesting photo and in my opinion very artistic which I totally respect. Against my better judgment I''m scoring your photo a 10.', '2008-09-18 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
