(4962044, 720987, 62187, '<td valign="top">He''s not safe from a shoe smashing his guts out! Which is probably what I would have done. Gerrrr-osssssss!</td>', 'He''s not safe from a shoe smashing his guts out! Which is probably what I would have done. Gerrrr-osssssss!', '2008-09-18 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962050, 721290, 62187, '<td valign="top">Whatever, I think it''s a silly, senseless idea and I''m tired of looking at condoms for this challenge. However, I''ll not vote with my personal feelings about your choice of subject matter. Condoms are for safety and the photo is excellent. I''d be embarrassed to have this as a ribbon winner or even a photo in my portfolio but certainly you must not. I''m sure you could say the same about photos in my portfolio. Regardless of my feelings I''m giving you a 10. I hope your happy although I''m sure my comments are not very helpful.</td>', 'Whatever, I think it''s a silly, senseless idea and I''m tired of looking at condoms for this challenge. However, I''ll not vote with my personal feelings about your choice of subject matter. Condoms are for safety and the photo is excellent. I''d be embarrassed to have this as a ribbon winner or even a photo in my portfolio but certainly you must not. I''m sure you could say the same about photos in my portfolio. Regardless of my feelings I''m giving you a 10. I hope your happy although I''m sure my comments are not very helpful.', '2008-09-18 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962051, 722398, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yep, gotta have ''em just like Safety Goggles. I wear both every day. The idea is novel but I think the execution could be a bit better? I think it''s in all the dead space I have trouble with.</td>', 'Yep, gotta have ''em just like Safety Goggles. I wear both every day. The idea is novel but I think the execution could be a bit better? I think it''s in all the dead space I have trouble with.', '2008-09-18 16:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962061, 722100, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. I think your photo could be improved by a tighter crop: as in not being able to see the mirror frame in the final photo. Also, it looks a lot over-sharpened but I do know that those kind of lines are hard to deal with in photos of this size. They turn all jaggy.</td>', 'Excellent idea. I think your photo could be improved by a tighter crop: as in not being able to see the mirror frame in the final photo. Also, it looks a lot over-sharpened but I do know that those kind of lines are hard to deal with in photos of this size. They turn all jaggy.', '2008-09-18 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962063, 722028, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  I find your post processing to be a bit overdone for my personal tastes.  I think the blown out background has a lot to do with the overdone post processing feel.</td>', 'Back to comment: I have to believe that the majority of voters will have trouble relating your image to safety.  I find your post processing to be a bit overdone for my personal tastes.  I think the blown out background has a lot to do with the overdone post processing feel.', '2008-09-18 16:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962066, 720919, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Safety is a tough subject for a challenge and after a second look; I can appreciate your take on the subject. Hopefully, the DNMC Police don''t hit you too hard, as the connection doesn''t hit you over the head. I think the b&amp;w conversion is very well done.  Overall, the subject is not very exciting and will make it easy for the voters to vote 5 or lower and move on.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Safety is a tough subject for a challenge and after a second look; I can appreciate your take on the subject. Hopefully, the DNMC Police don''t hit you too hard, as the connection doesn''t hit you over the head. I think the b&w conversion is very well done.  Overall, the subject is not very exciting and will make it easy for the voters to vote 5 or lower and move on.', '2008-09-18 16:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962069, 721856, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is excellent. However, I could not tell what your photo was of and I didn''t know off-hand what ''Giro'' was. I had to google it to find out. I think that''s kind of a bad idea for such an awesome photo. I may be wrong but I think that will keep you from getting a ribbon: unless everybody who doesn''t know what it is looks it up for themselves. Good luck to you, I''m going with a 9 and not a 10 because you caused me so much trouble! }:&gt;) Not really: 10!</td>', 'The photo is excellent. However, I could not tell what your photo was of and I didn''t know off-hand what ''Giro'' was. I had to google it to find out. I think that''s kind of a bad idea for such an awesome photo. I may be wrong but I think that will keep you from getting a ribbon: unless everybody who doesn''t know what it is looks it up for themselves. Good luck to you, I''m going with a 9 and not a 10 because you caused me so much trouble! }:>) Not really: 10!', '2008-09-18 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962071, 722155, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, ok, family is safe: most of the time. Sometimes however, it''s a risk being around them! The photo is excellent: crop, contrast. Nice random candid shot too...9</td>', 'Yeah, ok, family is safe: most of the time. Sometimes however, it''s a risk being around them! The photo is excellent: crop, contrast. Nice random candid shot too...9', '2008-09-18 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
