(4962226, 721170, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo but I''m wondering how we are supposed to tell (without the title) that the bird is indeed ''at Home''? Home is certainly ''Safe'' but it actually looks more like it''s in the wild which would be the opposite of home and not very safe at all: right?</td>', 'An excellent photo but I''m wondering how we are supposed to tell (without the title) that the bird is indeed ''at Home''? Home is certainly ''Safe'' but it actually looks more like it''s in the wild which would be the opposite of home and not very safe at all: right?', '2008-09-18 17:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962228, 722178, 62187, '<td valign="top">If there weren''t so much red and green I might buy it. Lovely otherwise...</td>', 'If there weren''t so much red and green I might buy it. Lovely otherwise...', '2008-09-18 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962238, 721271, 62187, '<td valign="top">Focus seems slightly off but what a good observation!</td>', 'Focus seems slightly off but what a good observation!', '2008-09-18 17:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962244, 722106, 62187, '<td valign="top">''In His Arms''...and looking at her breasts: typical man! Too cliche for my tastes but the photo quality is perfect. I''m sure you''ll do well: 10</td>', '''In His Arms''...and looking at her breasts: typical man! Too cliche for my tastes but the photo quality is perfect. I''m sure you''ll do well: 10', '2008-09-18 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962305, 722390, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very strong shot - clean crisp and perfectly focussed.<br/> <br/>should do very well.</td>', 'Very strong shot - clean crisp and perfectly focussed. should do very well.', '2008-09-18 17:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962307, 722218, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lol - looks jsut the right outfit to wear when cleaning the kid''s bedrooms as well  :- )<br/> <br/>Love the idea and the bright colours.</td>', 'Lol - looks jsut the right outfit to wear when cleaning the kid''s bedrooms as well  :- ) Love the idea and the bright colours.', '2008-09-18 17:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962308, 720608, 68586, '<td valign="top">really interesting colours on this looks almost like an ''acid'' effect.<br/> <br/>Good example of Safety at work.</td>', 'really interesting colours on this looks almost like an ''acid'' effect. Good example of Safety at work.', '2008-09-18 17:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962315, 721772, 68586, '<td valign="top">Safe harbour - are you kidding me - the poor things getting crushed !!<br/> <br/>But then again I guess there are worse ways to go  :- )</td>', 'Safe harbour - are you kidding me - the poor things getting crushed !! But then again I guess there are worse ways to go  :- )', '2008-09-18 18:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962317, 721793, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot with excellent lighting.<br/> <br/>Could do well.</td>', 'Really interesting shot with excellent lighting. Could do well.', '2008-09-18 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962321, 721290, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about ''safe'' - looks like they''re having a party to me - especially that middle one  :- )</td>', 'I''m not sure about ''safe'' - looks like they''re having a party to me - especially that middle one  :- )', '2008-09-18 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962326, 720408, 68586, '<td valign="top">''What can go wrong?'' - well I suppose this giant flaming meteorite could come crashing out the sky and crush them - I don''t see no giant flaming metiorite protection anywhere !!<br/> <br/>unless it''s already in place at the top of the tree . .<br/>D''oh - my bad . .<br/> <br/>But that aside you''re right - it does look like a lovely safe environment  :- )</td>', '''What can go wrong?'' - well I suppose this giant flaming meteorite could come crashing out the sky and crush them - I don''t see no giant flaming metiorite protection anywhere !! unless it''s already in place at the top of the tree . .D''oh - my bad . . But that aside you''re right - it does look like a lovely safe environment  :- )', '2008-09-18 18:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962327, 721154, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wow - amazing picture.</td>', 'Wow - amazing picture.', '2008-09-18 18:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962330, 722155, 67258, '<td valign="top">That almost looks like an evacuee label on his back!  Beautifully captured, with a real sense of empathy.  There is almost a 1950s photo-journalistic feel y=to this.</td>', 'That almost looks like an evacuee label on his back!  Beautifully captured, with a real sense of empathy.  There is almost a 1950s photo-journalistic feel y=to this.', '2008-09-18 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962334, 722253, 68586, '<td valign="top">''A Brother, A Guardian'' and darn it better looking as well !!<br/> <br/>Sweet shot, nicely taken and composed - are they Parrots ?</td>', '''A Brother, A Guardian'' and darn it better looking as well !! Sweet shot, nicely taken and composed - are they Parrots ?', '2008-09-18 18:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962336, 722223, 68586, '<td valign="top">Jeepers - if that squirrel just smashed the chestnut open using those two rocks you want to keep well away from him !!</td>', 'Jeepers - if that squirrel just smashed the chestnut open using those two rocks you want to keep well away from him !!', '2008-09-18 18:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962337, 722196, 67258, '<td valign="top">The shape of the lighthouse would suggest that this isn''t in the UK - did other countries have Fisherman''s Friend lozenges?  The beam from the lighthouse reflecting on the water in such an understated way takes this from the mundane into something t=far more interesting.  Nicely observed.</td>', 'The shape of the lighthouse would suggest that this isn''t in the UK - did other countries have Fisherman''s Friend lozenges?  The beam from the lighthouse reflecting on the water in such an understated way takes this from the mundane into something t=far more interesting.  Nicely observed.', '2008-09-18 18:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962340, 722012, 68586, '<td valign="top">C''mon Tim - stop with the Judo moves on Rowen - pick on someone your own size  :- P</td>', 'C''mon Tim - stop with the Judo moves on Rowen - pick on someone your own size  :- P', '2008-09-18 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962341, 721263, 67258, '<td valign="top">The best of the condom photos so far. You have thought the photo out well, and for me the choice of DoF is spot on.</td>', 'The best of the condom photos so far. You have thought the photo out well, and for me the choice of DoF is spot on.', '2008-09-18 18:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962344, 722323, 68586, '<td valign="top">''Keeper of the Keys'' are you kidding me ?? <br/> <br/>The fish has clearly been drinking - I can see the bottles . .</td>', '''Keeper of the Keys'' are you kidding me ??  The fish has clearly been drinking - I can see the bottles . .', '2008-09-18 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962348, 722341, 68586, '<td valign="top">lovely shot - should do very well.</td>', 'lovely shot - should do very well.', '2008-09-18 18:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962352, 722155, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really like the feeling of depth in this shot with the people in the foreground nice and clear and the street receding in focus and clarity.<br/> <br/>Only thing I''m not sure of is whether I would rather have had the lady''s head in the shot. Hmmm - not sure.</td>', 'Really like the feeling of depth in this shot with the people in the foreground nice and clear and the street receding in focus and clarity. Only thing I''m not sure of is whether I would rather have had the lady''s head in the shot. Hmmm - not sure.', '2008-09-18 18:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962354, 721287, 68586, '<td valign="top">Now that''s one good looking nest !<br/> <br/>I will have to look again later to see what sort it is.</td>', 'Now that''s one good looking nest ! I will have to look again later to see what sort it is.', '2008-09-18 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962356, 722222, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love the textures in this - brought out beautifully by the B&amp;W processing.</td>', 'Love the textures in this - brought out beautifully by the B&W processing.', '2008-09-18 18:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962361, 722332, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the duotone effect.</td>', 'Great shot - love the duotone effect.', '2008-09-18 18:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962366, 721673, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice clean shot - good composition and colours.</td>', 'nice clean shot - good composition and colours.', '2008-09-18 18:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
