(4962835, 722338, 86447, '<td valign="top">Yup.  Thank him for me, too!    Good idea.   I wish he didn''t have his sunglasses on.  It would be more ''personal''.</td>', 'Yup.  Thank him for me, too!    Good idea.   I wish he didn''t have his sunglasses on.  It would be more ''personal''.', '2008-09-18 21:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962836, 722117, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.', '2008-09-18 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962837, 722159, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!    What an image!</td>', 'LOL!    What an image!', '2008-09-18 21:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962838, 722341, 86447, '<td valign="top">beautifully emotive!</td>', 'beautifully emotive!', '2008-09-18 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962841, 720608, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice safety image.  Fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Nice safety image.  Fits the challenge perfectly.', '2008-09-18 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962843, 722312, 86447, '<td valign="top">The eye bothers me.  But, the composition really sings!</td>', 'The eye bothers me.  But, the composition really sings!', '2008-09-18 21:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962844, 721888, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!     Poor girl!  LOL!</td>', 'LOL!     Poor girl!  LOL!', '2008-09-18 21:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962846, 722335, 86447, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed.   A bit light in the PP... seems washed out.  But, that might be my monitor.</td>', 'Perfectly composed.   A bit light in the PP... seems washed out.  But, that might be my monitor.', '2008-09-18 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962848, 722288, 86447, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting to me.  I keep trying to figure it out.   I think the thimbles would have been enough.</td>', 'The background is distracting to me.  I keep trying to figure it out.   I think the thimbles would have been enough.', '2008-09-18 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962849, 722398, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit off, I think.  But, I really like the composition.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit off, I think.  But, I really like the composition.', '2008-09-18 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962850, 722005, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit freely that I don''t get this at all.  I see the safety pin on the strap, but I don''t know what the focal point is.  I see the martini glass, then the stripes of the mini-blinds, then the shadows of the drink against her dress, then the safety pin.  I suppose that the fact that my eye was actually brought into the story in such a fashion is actually a good thing.  But the subtly in this one is really obtuse.</td>', 'I''ll admit freely that I don''t get this at all.  I see the safety pin on the strap, but I don''t know what the focal point is.  I see the martini glass, then the stripes of the mini-blinds, then the shadows of the drink against her dress, then the safety pin.  I suppose that the fact that my eye was actually brought into the story in such a fashion is actually a good thing.  But the subtly in this one is really obtuse.', '2008-09-18 21:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962851, 722323, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  Could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  Could be a bit sharper.', '2008-09-18 21:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962852, 721853, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!    My favorite of the condom entries.</td>', 'LOL!    My favorite of the condom entries.', '2008-09-18 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962853, 722261, 97225, '<td valign="top">I can relate to that. I just had my husband to the doctor coz he drilled under the trailer with only glasses on, and got stuff in his eye.</td>', 'I can relate to that. I just had my husband to the doctor coz he drilled under the trailer with only glasses on, and got stuff in his eye.', '2008-09-18 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962855, 722218, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2008-09-18 21:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962857, 721290, 86447, '<td valign="top">Clever title, for sure.  I hope they can breathe in there.</td>', 'Clever title, for sure.  I hope they can breathe in there.', '2008-09-18 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962858, 722222, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Nice and sharp.  Good textures.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Nice and sharp.  Good textures.', '2008-09-18 21:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962859, 721287, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish the bird were a bit more visible.   He''s adorable.</td>', 'I wish the bird were a bit more visible.   He''s adorable.', '2008-09-18 21:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962860, 722341, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and you can see the pleasure in her eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and you can see the pleasure in her eyes.', '2008-09-18 21:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962861, 722390, 86447, '<td valign="top">Good "Safety" image.   I like the PP.</td>', 'Good "Safety" image.   I like the PP.', '2008-09-18 21:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962863, 722108, 86447, '<td valign="top">Definitely says "Safety" to me.   Good image for the challenge.</td>', 'Definitely says "Safety" to me.   Good image for the challenge.', '2008-09-18 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962864, 721170, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture.  DOF is good, colors work well together.<br/> <br/>My issue is that the picture doesn''t convey safety.  I only get there because you tell me it''s about safety.  I''m not going to DNMC this because I do see the nest and the bird is at home.</td>', 'This is a nice picture.  DOF is good, colors work well together. My issue is that the picture doesn''t convey safety.  I only get there because you tell me it''s about safety.  I''m not going to DNMC this because I do see the nest and the bird is at home.', '2008-09-18 21:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962866, 721909, 97225, '<td valign="top">Yeah... you''d think nothing could go wrong.It is busy but it works.</td>', 'Yeah... you''d think nothing could go wrong.It is busy but it works.', '2008-09-18 21:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
