(4963828, 722212, 97954, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of safety. I think the eyes in the front person are a bit out of focus, I think the auto focus went to the goggles instead of the eyes.</td>', 'Good portrayal of safety. I think the eyes in the front person are a bit out of focus, I think the auto focus went to the goggles instead of the eyes.', '2008-09-19 10:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963830, 722046, 32011, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see "safety" in a lot of pills spelling "forget her"?<br/> <br/>Looking at the image though, there''s a confusion with the light sources here.. one top right, another bottom left, yet there''s not really enough light in the top left where your message begins... and the ripped paper?  Is there any significance to it?  Does it add to the story?  Perhaps some words from a letter the "her" or a poem, or a song might have given more depth to the story, and this image.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see "safety" in a lot of pills spelling "forget her"? Looking at the image though, there''s a confusion with the light sources here.. one top right, another bottom left, yet there''s not really enough light in the top left where your message begins... and the ripped paper?  Is there any significance to it?  Does it add to the story?  Perhaps some words from a letter the "her" or a poem, or a song might have given more depth to the story, and this image.', '2008-09-19 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963833, 722288, 97954, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too much empty space above the thimbles but love the contrasty black and white of the thimbles.</td>', 'I think it''s too much empty space above the thimbles but love the contrasty black and white of the thimbles.', '2008-09-19 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963835, 722138, 97954, '<td valign="top">If the title didn''t say it, this photo wouldn''t say safety to me but I like it as a photo overall. :)</td>', 'If the title didn''t say it, this photo wouldn''t say safety to me but I like it as a photo overall. :)', '2008-09-19 10:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963836, 722189, 32011, '<td valign="top">Cute kid.  Shame it''s OOF.  The composition too is a bit off... the space on the left doesn''t add anything to the image, and the stain on the sofa (is it a sofa?) is rather distracting.</td>', 'Cute kid.  Shame it''s OOF.  The composition too is a bit off... the space on the left doesn''t add anything to the image, and the stain on the sofa (is it a sofa?) is rather distracting.', '2008-09-19 10:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
