(4963871, 722253, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo... shoehorned a little perhaps, but I think it''s a reasonable fit  ;)<br/> <br/>The shadow on the back is a bit of a shame, and the black at the top/back is a little bit too much... causes the image to be a little unbalance (in my eye).  The shallow DOF works well to take the foreground out of the picture (in terms of distractions that is).</td>', 'Beautiful photo... shoehorned a little perhaps, but I think it''s a reasonable fit  ;) The shadow on the back is a bit of a shame, and the black at the top/back is a little bit too much... causes the image to be a little unbalance (in my eye).  The shallow DOF works well to take the foreground out of the picture (in terms of distractions that is).', '2008-09-19 10:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
