(4964971, 721776, 35602, '<td valign="top">Best fire extinguisher shot of the bunch.  Great use of light painting.</td>', 'Best fire extinguisher shot of the bunch.  Great use of light painting.', '2008-09-19 20:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965023, 722183, 32011, '<td valign="top">Lighting isn''t the best, as the bulk of the insect is much too dark.  The texture in the background is very distraction.  Perhaps if you tweaked the exposure a little (or the brightness and contrast if you''re not shooting in RAW) to lose the background and bring out some of the detail s lost in the shadows.  Focus is also a little off.  Good effort though.</td>', 'Lighting isn''t the best, as the bulk of the insect is much too dark.  The texture in the background is very distraction.  Perhaps if you tweaked the exposure a little (or the brightness and contrast if you''re not shooting in RAW) to lose the background and bring out some of the detail s lost in the shadows.  Focus is also a little off.  Good effort though.', '2008-09-19 21:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965027, 722294, 32011, '<td valign="top">Good idea for this challenge, though I feel it''s a little too cluttered and slightly out-of-focus.</td>', 'Good idea for this challenge, though I feel it''s a little too cluttered and slightly out-of-focus.', '2008-09-19 21:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965043, 722108, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, however there''s not enough of a connection with the subject.  Back of heads works sometimes, but I for this challenge, I think an emotional connection to the mother and child would have helped.  Hard to get the gridiron game in if you took it from the other side, thereby eliminating the "story" in the photo, same too if you had them pose for the shot... hard, I know.  Let''s leave that aspect.  The composition isn''t bad, the use of a shallow DOF works here, as the background adds context to the story without being too much of a distraction.  Not sure why you chose to go with B&amp;W with this.</td>', 'Nice idea, however there''s not enough of a connection with the subject.  Back of heads works sometimes, but I for this challenge, I think an emotional connection to the mother and child would have helped.  Hard to get the gridiron game in if you took it from the other side, thereby eliminating the "story" in the photo, same too if you had them pose for the shot... hard, I know.  Let''s leave that aspect.  The composition isn''t bad, the use of a shallow DOF works here, as the background adds context to the story without being too much of a distraction.  Not sure why you chose to go with B&W with this.', '2008-09-19 22:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965117, 720759, 98182, '<td valign="top">cool picture plain but efective nice job michael</td>', 'cool picture plain but efective nice job michael', '2008-09-19 22:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965141, 722099, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is quite abstract, which does not really add to the challenge.  Shallow DOF works to keep it abstract, though doesn''t really help the image sell the "safety" theme.  The crop isn''t great either... the area on the left doesn''t do anything for this... then there''s the glare and reflection which is really just too distracting for my liking.</td>', 'This is quite abstract, which does not really add to the challenge.  Shallow DOF works to keep it abstract, though doesn''t really help the image sell the "safety" theme.  The crop isn''t great either... the area on the left doesn''t do anything for this... then there''s the glare and reflection which is really just too distracting for my liking.', '2008-09-19 23:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965146, 720987, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp on the baby, but I think the DOF is a little too shallow.  Also, the light is a tad too harsh and the glare on the insect takes away from the "baby" a little.</td>', 'Nice and sharp on the baby, but I think the DOF is a little too shallow.  Also, the light is a tad too harsh and the glare on the insect takes away from the "baby" a little.', '2008-09-19 23:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965147, 721154, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image.  Abstract meets heritage architecture... works for me... even under the theme of "safety".  I think the image could have benefited from a little more saturation, as the reds look a little flat.  Also, you might have cropped a little off the bottom as it adds little to the image.</td>', 'This is a very interesting image.  Abstract meets heritage architecture... works for me... even under the theme of "safety".  I think the image could have benefited from a little more saturation, as the reds look a little flat.  Also, you might have cropped a little off the bottom as it adds little to the image.', '2008-09-19 23:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965250, 721705, 32011, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and I like the idea of including the the candle and wine.  The wood grain at the bottom of the image is a negative.. the overall crop actually, doesn''t work for me.  Also, the colours is a bit too yellow.</td>', 'Good lighting and I like the idea of including the the candle and wine.  The wood grain at the bottom of the image is a negative.. the overall crop actually, doesn''t work for me.  Also, the colours is a bit too yellow.', '2008-09-20 00:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965379, 722012, 97166, '<td valign="top">Ironically, I get a sense of not safety in this shot, but one of threatening.  Whether it''s a sense of tension in the pose, or something else, I can''t really place it, but my first reaction wasn''t the one I think you meant.</td>', 'Ironically, I get a sense of not safety in this shot, but one of threatening.  Whether it''s a sense of tension in the pose, or something else, I can''t really place it, but my first reaction wasn''t the one I think you meant.', '2008-09-20 06:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965471, 722138, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like this image...I like the composition. But, it does not say safety to me...take away the title and what do you have? I boy on a road.</td>', 'I like this image...I like the composition. But, it does not say safety to me...take away the title and what do you have? I boy on a road.', '2008-09-20 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
