(4970506, 722106, 91614, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful image. I love the lighting and the soft tones. Very emotional. It really gives the viewer feelings of protection and comfort. You nailed the theme. I gave it a 9. The only reason it''s not a ten for me is because of the harsh bright spots on his arm, his face, and her nose. They''re a little distracting. But i love the overall contrast of the image. Great job! :)</td>', 'This is a really beautiful image. I love the lighting and the soft tones. Very emotional. It really gives the viewer feelings of protection and comfort. You nailed the theme. I gave it a 9. The only reason it''s not a ten for me is because of the harsh bright spots on his arm, his face, and her nose. They''re a little distracting. But i love the overall contrast of the image. Great job! :)', '2008-09-23 18:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4970508, 722138, 91614, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this photo. They''re very bright and cheerful. I gave it a 9. The only reason for me why it''s not a ten is because of the lack of contrast. There''s not many very light tones or very dark tones. The tonal range is kind of blah, but as i said, I really do like it. It gives the viewer feelings of peace, serenity, calm, and therefore safety. Great job. :)</td>', 'I love the colors in this photo. They''re very bright and cheerful. I gave it a 9. The only reason for me why it''s not a ten is because of the lack of contrast. There''s not many very light tones or very dark tones. The tonal range is kind of blah, but as i said, I really do like it. It gives the viewer feelings of peace, serenity, calm, and therefore safety. Great job. :)', '2008-09-23 18:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4970510, 721170, 91614, '<td valign="top">I love how the birds personality is captured in this photo. Great job! :)</td>', 'I love how the birds personality is captured in this photo. Great job! :)', '2008-09-23 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
