(4974028, 722196, 70514, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 during voting.  I love it.  The ripples in the water, the star effect (which says what I know about things, apparently- :) ), the detail of the rock and birds... just so beautiful.  The saddest thing I think is this is a 14th place image with a 5.8 score.  Oh well.  This is a wonderful image.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 during voting.  I love it.  The ripples in the water, the star effect (which says what I know about things, apparently- :) ), the detail of the rock and birds... just so beautiful.  The saddest thing I think is this is a 14th place image with a 5.8 score.  Oh well.  This is a wonderful image.', '2008-09-25 01:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4974029, 722155, 70514, '<td valign="top">This put such a smile on my face.  I LOVE it!  The bit of motion blur, Mom leading the way, and a child''s trust. Great capture.  Wish I had something like this of myself with my girls.  I love it.</td>', 'This put such a smile on my face.  I LOVE it!  The bit of motion blur, Mom leading the way, and a child''s trust. Great capture.  Wish I had something like this of myself with my girls.  I love it.', '2008-09-25 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
